FastAPI + Jinja2 templates. The banner script is served from /static and carries the request's CSP nonce (with 'strict-dynamic' the nonce, not 'self', lets it run). Include _consent.html at the end of <body> in base.html. Replace G-XXXXXXXXXX with your Google tag ID, keep the labels equal to consent.banner.acceptLabel/rejectLabel/reopenLabel, and list the cookie "consent" in essentialCookies. In app/security.py (headers recipe) extend the CSP string's connect-src and img-src with the Google beacons, never script-src: connect-src 'self' https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://www.googletagmanager.com; img-src 'self' data: https://www.google-analytics.com;
