FastAPI + Jinja2Templates (pip install jinja2). Unknown URL -> real 404 page; unknown path parameters (FastAPI would answer 422) -> 404; retired path -> 410; database/upstream failure -> 503; any other crash -> 500. HTML pages render inside the site layout (templates/base.html); /api/ paths keep JSON errors. Handlers are registered for Starlette's HTTPException so router-level 404/405 are caught too. Pages are noindex with no canonical link.
