FastAPI. Contact form delivered to FORM_WEBHOOK_URL with httpx (8 s timeout, raise_for_status); success only when the webhook accepted it, otherwise 502 with the form and an error. Needs: pip install python-multipart httpx slowapi jinja2. CSRF: FastAPI has none, so an Origin check (fallback Sec-Fetch-Site) rejects cross-site non-GET requests with 403. Abuse: slowapi 429 after 5 per 10 minutes (pass storage_uri="redis://..." to Limiter when you run more than one worker; run uvicorn with --proxy-headers behind a proxy) plus a visually hidden honeypot (for Cloudflare Turnstile, verify cf-turnstile-response server-side before sending). Extends base.html from the error-pages recipe.
